# Hiring prompts live here as one *.prompt.yaml per prompt, e.g.:
#   intake.prompt.yaml, resume-rank.prompt.yaml, screening.prompt.yaml, summary.prompt.yaml
# Generate via COPILOT_PROMPTS.md (or python ../../copilot_prompts.py --usecase hiring).
# Grounding rule: judgements must be supported by the resume text; no invented experience.
# This .gitkeep keeps the empty folder in Git until the first prompt is added.
